

Teksto kapag: ['html'] gawin: { <- (
		sarili
		palitan: ['&'] ng: ['&amp;'],
		palitan: ['<'] ng: ['&lt;'],
		palitan: ['>'] ng: ['&gt;'],
		palitan: ['"'] ng: ['&quot;']
	).
}.


Labas isulat: ([' left trimmed '] tabasin) + [' '] + ( ['and right trimmed'] tabasin) + ['!'], bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ['<html>"html & entities"</html>'] html.
